    note: '<code class="font-mono text-sm">new _enquire({ [minWidth]: (enquire) => {} })</code>. <code class="font-mono text-sm">enquire.breakpoint</code> is the width it entered, <code class="font-mono text-sm">enquire.prevBreakpoint</code> the one it left (<code class="font-mono text-sm">null</code> on load). Below the smallest key nothing runs. Call <code class="font-mono text-sm">destroy()</code> to stop listening. To run on every resize instead, use <code class="font-mono text-sm">_event.resize</code>.'
}) }}

